    "text": "Let the slope of the tangent to a curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;be given by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. if the curve passes through the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
